fixture dash_down_lands_no_lag
doc BUILD.md s5 Jump "Landing: 0 f of lag"; docs/adr/0010 "a straight-down dash ends on the floor"
room test/flat
spawn 400 520
frames 30
input
  # A straight-down air dash meets the floor on its first frame; the stick and a jump work at once.
  0 D dash
  2 R jump
  3..29 R
end
expect
  at 0 event.dash=1 state=dash
  # The dash reaches the floor on its second frame: it ends there, a landing, and the next frame's
  # jump and stick act at once.
  at 1 event.land=1 state=ground dash_frame=0
  at 2 event.jump=1 vx>0
end
